      "writtenOn": "2017-12-12T20:04:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we shouldn\u0027t just say \u0027validity\u0027 because it may cause people to think that it belongs to the current carrier. We should clearly define what we mean by validity here.",
